<title>GERMANY: German November vehicle output rises five percent.</title>
<headline>German November vehicle output rises five percent.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German car and van production and export figures for November issued by the German Automobile Industry Association VDA showed increases in output and exports.</p>
<p>Production</p>
<p>				  Nov 96		 Change vs Nov 95</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles    438,000		up    5 pct</p>
<p>    Vans			 30,400		0</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes  20,100		up   15 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks	     10,300		down 20 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles	    469,200		up    5 pct</p>
<p>Exports</p>
<p>				  Nov 96		 Change vs Nov 95</p>
<p>    Passenger vehicles    271,100		up   16 pct</p>
<p>    Vans			 17,900		up   11 pct</p>
<p>    Trucks up to 6 tonnes  12,200		up   37 pct</p>
<p>    Heavy trucks		5,700		down 21 pct</p>
<p>    All vehicles	    289,000		up   16 pct</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
